WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
For centuries, many families
followed one pattern:

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.770
the man earned the money,
and the woman ran the home.

3
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:11.690
Yet Genesis says that male and female
were both created in God's image.

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.760
And believers read other verses as
giving husband and wife different roles,

5
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.200
or shared ones.

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.530
Today, in most couples,
both partners work.

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.150
So who should do what in a
family: equal but different,

8
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.160
or equal and the same?

9
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.090
In this mission, you'll meet two
ways Christians answer that question,

10
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.010
and the texts behind each.

11
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:36.810
Then you'll decide how believers
might see one modern family's choices.

12
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:41.600
Your mission: explain how faiths answer
the question of who should do what in

13
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:42.370
a family.
